Q-COST release licensing status

No new license is assigned by this reproduction packaging.
The Q-COST authors must confirm the license and redistribution permission for
their research source, original model weights and experimental metadata before
public GitHub publication. Until then, no project-wide grant is implied.

The existing QMap-LI notice is preserved in licenses/QMap-LI.LICENSE and applies
only to the corresponding upstream material. External baseline dependencies
retain their own licenses and are fetched separately at recorded revisions.
Dataset downloads are subject to the upstream providers' terms.
